<% content_for :title, 'The house — Strucxil' %>

<header class="page-hero">
  <p class="eyebrow">The house</p>
  <h1>Hallmark, weight and word.</h1>
  <p class="lede" style="margin:0 auto">Strucxil is built for the jewellery house before it is a shop. Gold is spoken of in grams, purity and the mark that travels with the piece.</p>
</header>

<section class="section" style="padding-top:24px">
  <div class="wrap split">
    <div class="copy reveal">
      <p class="eyebrow">Our word</p>
      <h2>Built like a maison, run like an atelier.</h2>
      <p class="lede">The public rooms are for viewing. Behind them sits the book: clients, rates of the day, catalogue pieces and bills. Staff open the atelier to weigh, hallmark and raise an invoice without leaving the language of jewellery.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="photo-frame reveal delay-1">
      <img src="<%= maison_photo(:portrait, width: 1400) %>" alt="Jewellery worn in warm light">
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section ivory">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="eyebrow reveal">What we keep</p>
    <h2 class="reveal">Three promises of the house</h2>
    <div class="feat-grid">
      <article class="feat reveal">
        <b>01</b>
        <h3>Metal as it is</h3>
        <p>Gold, silver and platinum are named, coloured and hallmarked. Each purity carries its own remaining weight in the house.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="feat reveal delay-1">
        <b>02</b>
        <h3>A rate that holds</h3>
        <p>Today’s board is ₹ per gram. A necklace is not a guess — it is purity rate × weight × quantity, then making and tax.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="feat reveal delay-2">
        <b>03</b>
        <h3>A bill with a face</h3>
        <p>The invoice carries the client’s papers, HUID and HSN. It should read as the piece does in the tray.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap split reverse">
    <div class="photo-frame reveal">
      <img src="<%= maison_photo(:tray, width: 1400) %>" alt="Jewellery on a dark tray">
    </div>
    <div class="copy reveal delay-1">
      <p class="eyebrow">For jewellers</p>
      <h2>Open a house of your own.</h2>
      <p class="lede">Strucxil PVT LTD powers showrooms: catalogue, rates, clients and bills in one house book. Create an account, choose a yearly plan, and set up your shop name as it should appear on the bill head.</p>
      <div class="hero-ctas">
        <%= link_to 'Create an account', new_user_registration_path, class: 'btn-gold' %>
        <%= link_to 'Write to us', contact_path, class: 'btn-ghost' %>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
